  },
  {
   "id": "note-pattern",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -560,
   "y": 270,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 290,
   "text": "**Layer pattern** — 50 sliding + 10 full layers (L5, L11, … L59; the last layer is always full).  \nSliding layers see the last 1024 tokens; full layers see the whole context with fewer, wider KV heads.  \nKV cache per token per layer: sliding 2 × 16 × 256 = 8,192 values (kept for 1024 tokens at most); full 2 × 4 × 512 = 4,096 — K and V come from the same k_proj, V just skips k_norm's weight and RoPE."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-layer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -560,
   "y": 600,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**Layer sizes** — sliding 479.0M (attention 132.1M), full 534.0M (attention 187.2M); GeGLU MLP 346.8M in every layer.  \nLogits: tied lm head, then softcap 30·tanh(z / 30).  \nImage tokens attend to each other bidirectionally (use_bidirectional_attention = \"vision\"); text stays causal."
  },
  {
   "id": "img8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**image** pixels (video: sampled frames)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "patch9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -511,
   "y": -864,
   "width": 61,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1090,
   "y": -874,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`patches [P, 768]  (16×16×3), P = 2,520 by default`"
  },
  {
   "id": "pe11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -810,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**patch embed** 768 → 1152  \n+ learned x / y position tables 2 × 10,240  \n24.5M",
   "color": "#a78bfa"
  },
  {
   "id": "vf012",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -526,
   "y": -680,
   "width": 92,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1090,
   "y": -690,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[P, 1152]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "vit14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -626,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**ViT ×27** — bidirectional · 16 heads × 72  \n2D RoPE θ 100 · q/k norm · GeGLU 4304  \n545.1M",
   "color": "#a78bfa"
  },
  {
