   "y": 1254,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`draft ids — 6 per round, one per step`"
  },
  {
   "id": "dver46",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1850,
   "y": 1318,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**verify**: main model scores all 6  \ndrafts in one forward pass",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dpost",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1490,
   "y": 1040,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**post_projection** 1024 → 5376  \nh' becomes the next step's “last hidden”  \n5.5M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-taph",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 865,
   "y": 960,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ last hidden h + embed(last token) → drafter"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-draft",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1850,
   "y": 1420,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**MTP drafter, shipped separately** (google/gemma-4-31B-it-assistant, 469.5M, 48 tensors; **not counted** in the bars above). It has no K/V projections: every drafter layer attends with its own queries to the 31B's cached keys/values (sliding layers → L58, full layer → L59) at one fixed position, so it needs no prefill. Each step feeds the token it just drafted (embedded by the 31B's table) plus its projected hidden state back in. use_ordered_embeddings = false, so the centroid-masked head is off and no centroid tensors ship."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1100,
   "y": 840,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "**Sources.** config.json + safetensors headers of google/gemma-4-31B-it (1188 tensors, all BF16) and of the assistant repo. Dataflow from transformers models/gemma4 and models/gemma4_assistant (GitHub main). No audio tower in this size (audio_config = null). Context 262,144 positions. RMSNorms here scale by w (not 1 + w). The per-layer scalar is a stored 1-element tensor; its value is not shown."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bpt",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1746,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**Where the parameters are stored (main checkpoint, BF16; the separate drafter is not included)** — total 31.27B"
  },
  {
